WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.820
A train stops: «Le train s'arrêta.»
A woman stays in her seat:

2
00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:09.150
«Hélène ne bougea pas.» At last
she steps down with her suitcase.

3
00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.720
«Le train repartit
derrière elle.» Far off,

4
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.740
a village «semblait l'attendre
sans la reconnaître».

5
00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.920
A woman gets off a train.

6
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.340
Is that really all this page does?

7
00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:21.160
Given one page of a novel,

8
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.310
how do you show what the writer is doing,

9
00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.990
not just what happens?

10
00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:28.960
In this mission, you'll build
the analysis chain in Mission D2,

11
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.430
link by link.

12
00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:34.430
Then you'll drag word chips into
one sharp sentence in Mission I1,

13
00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:38.180
and plan a whole answer in Mission D3.

14
00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.190
Your mission: find out
what this one page is

15
00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:42.530
doing to its reader.
